    "body": "## SUPERSEDED — LEGACY TEAM / MULTI-AGENT OPERATING MODEL\n\nFresh main `80956a43df9d939b2ce39f806fb67a72d2705ac8` now has the simplified DUNCAN PRIME root law in `AGENTS.md`: DUNCAN is the single root; SALVADOR is an internal facet; product work uses the simplest sufficient system and one critical path.\n\nThis older JINGO/team operating model predates that durable identity/coordination law and must not remain an apparently live alternative authority.\n\nDisposition: close unmerged as `SUPERSEDED / HISTORICAL`. Preserve the old coordination design as history only.",
